<!--
  ============================================================
  MIGRATION NOTICE: packages.config → PackageReference (.NET 8)
  ============================================================
  This file is from the original .NET Framework 4.8 project.
  In the migrated .NET 8 SDK-style project, all packages are
  managed via <PackageReference> elements in the .csproj file.
  This file is retained for historical reference ONLY and is
  NOT used by the build system.

  ============================================================
  DEPENDENCY MIGRATION SUMMARY (.NET Framework 4.8 → .NET 8)
  DATABASE MIGRATION: MySQL → PostgreSQL 16
  ============================================================

  ISSUE 1 (CRITICAL - RESOLVED):
    Package: MySql.Data 8.3.0
    Status:  REPLACED - Migrated from MySql.Data to Npgsql 8.0.5
             Npgsql is the official .NET data provider for PostgreSQL 16.
             All MySqlConnection, MySqlCommand, MySqlDataReader, MySqlParameter,
             and MySqlException references have been replaced with their
             Npgsql equivalents (NpgsqlConnection, NpgsqlCommand, etc.)

  ISSUE 2 (CRITICAL - RESOLVED):
    Connection String Format: MySQL → PostgreSQL
    Status:  UPDATED - Connection string format changed from:
             "Server={host};Database={db};Uid={user};Pwd={pwd};"
             to PostgreSQL Npgsql format:
             "Host={host};Port={port};Database={db};Username={user};Password={pwd};"

  ISSUE 3 (CRITICAL - RESOLVED):
    Default Port: 3306 (MySQL) → 5432 (PostgreSQL)
    Status:  UPDATED in App.config and DatabaseConnection.Builder

  ISSUE 4 (HIGH - RESOLVED):
    SQL Syntax: MySQL-specific → PostgreSQL-compatible
    Status:  UPDATED:
             - "DELETE * FROM table" → "DELETE FROM table WHERE condition"
             - "?" parameter placeholders → "@paramName" named parameters
             - AUTO_INCREMENT → SERIAL / IDENTITY
             - MEDIUMBLOB → BYTEA
             - tinyint(1) → SMALLINT
             - ENGINE=InnoDB → removed (PostgreSQL default)
             - current_timestamp() → CURRENT_DATE / CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
             - LastInsertedId → RETURNING id clause

  ISSUE 5 (HIGH - RESOLVED):
    Error Code Handling: MySQL error numbers → PostgreSQL SQLSTATE codes
    Status:  UPDATED:
             - ex.Number == 1045 (wrong password) → ex.SqlState == "28P01"
             - ex.Number == 1042 (cannot connect) → ex.SqlState == "08001"
             - ex.Number == 1062 (duplicate entry) → ex.SqlState == "23505"

  PACKAGE CHANGES:
  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Original Package                    │ .NET 8 / PostgreSQL Resolution       │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ MySql.Data 8.3.0                    │ Npgsql 8.0.5 (PostgreSQL provider)   │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ AForge 2.2.5                        │ REMOVED - No .NET 8 support.         │
  │ AForge.Video 2.2.5                  │ Replace with OpenCvSharp4.Windows    │
  │ AForge.Video.DirectShow 2.2.5       │ or DirectShowLib-2005 when needed.   │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Portable.BouncyCastle 1.9.0         │ BouncyCastle.Cryptography 2.3.1      │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Newtonsoft.Json 13.0.1              │ Newtonsoft.Json 13.0.3               │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ System.Buffers 4.5.1                │ REMOVED - Built into .NET 8 BCL      │
  │ System.Memory 4.5.5                 │ REMOVED - Built into .NET 8 BCL      │
  │ System.Threading.Tasks.Extensions  │ REMOVED - Built into .NET 8 BCL      │
  │ System.ValueTuple 4.5.0            │ REMOVED - Built into .NET 8 BCL      │
  │ System.Runtime.CompilerServices... │ REMOVED - Built into .NET 8 BCL      │
